# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dunnhumby - repository hygiene
#
# Commit the pipeline, the notebook and the results. Not the source data
# (causal_data.csv alone is 664 MB) and not the rebuildable warehouse.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Source CSVs - download "The Complete Journey" from Dunnhumby
data/
*.csv

# The warehouse, rebuilt by the pipeline
artifacts/*.duckdb
artifacts/*.duckdb.wal

# Local environment
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Explicitly COMMITTED:
#   src/        the whole pipeline
#   notebooks/  the executed walkthrough
#   docs/       assumptions
#   results/    the estimated tables, as CSV
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!results/*.csv
